# Bulky, regeneratable local caches (prices/features/models) stay untracked --
# but training_runs/ and trades/ are small, human-readable records (past
# run metrics, the actual buy/sell log) that should never live only on one
# machine's disk. See storage/training_run_store.py, storage/trade_store.py.
data/*
!data/training_runs/
!data/trades/
bazel-*
.claude/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.bazelrc.user
.idea/
typescript/node_modules/
typescript/dist/
typescript/*.tsbuildinfo
